                                "sense_id": "a2dad588-d915-30d4-b23d-b1dc0480ad6d",
                                "text": "The apprenticeship of the Prussian Crown Princes has always consisted in receiving fisticuffs and cowhidings from their progenitor, the king."
                            }
                        ]
